  "content": "\n\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n<img alt=\"Exposure\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" width=225/>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n### 底片攝影模組\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img alt=\"Camera\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_camera.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Film\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_film.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Developing\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_developing.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Printing\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_printing.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Photograph\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_photograph.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Additional Features\" width=\"260\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_additional_features.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Chromatic\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_chromatic.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Interplanar Projector\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_projector.gif\"/>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/exposure-polaroid\"><img alt=\"Polaroid\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_polaroid.png\"/></a>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/exposure-catalog\"><img alt=\"Catalog\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_catalog.png\"/></a>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"Negatives\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_negatives.png\"/>\n\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n  \n<summary>文字版說明</summary>\n<h3>相機</h3>\n\n- 操作相機很簡單：裝入底片卷，打開觀景窗，構圖並按下快門。<br>\n- 透過觀景窗觀察時，按下或按住潛行鍵可調整相機設定：焦距、快門速度、閃光燈模式、構圖輔助線。<br>\n- 手持相機並按住潛行鍵可開啟附件視窗，您將能夠：\n    - 裝入底片\n    - 裝備閃光燈（紅石燈）\n    - 更換鏡頭（望遠鏡）\n    - 安裝鏡頭濾鏡（玻璃板）\n\n<h3>底片</h3>\n\n- 要拍攝照片，您需要使用感光底片進行曝光。\n- 您可以使用較簡單的黑白底片，或使用更複雜、製作與沖洗難度較高的彩色底片。\n- 一卷底片可拍攝 16 張照片。\n- 必須經過沖洗程序，才能將底片準備好用於印相。\n\n<h3>暗房（Lightroom）</h3>\n\n- 相片需借助 Lightroom 方塊進行印相。\n- 印相前可預覽底片（負片），以協助您選擇最佳的曝光效果。\n- 黑白印相需要紙張與黑色染料。彩色印相則需額外準備青色、洋紅色與黃色染料。\n\n<h3>相片</h3>\n\n最後，您就擁有了您的相片——一個被定格的瞬間！\n現在是欣賞成果的時候了，可以把它掛在牆上、與朋友分享，甚至賣給《國家地理雜誌》。可能性無限。\n\n</details>\n\n<iframe width=\"1000\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HI9Bnjc9HYs\" title=\"YouTube This Mod Adds Photography in Minecraft!\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<br><br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<h1><a href=\"https://moddedmc.wiki/en/project/exposure/latest/docs\">維基</a></h1>\n\n__已知不相容模組：__\n\n</div>\n\n- Optifine - 已知會與其他模組產生衝突。建議改用 Sodium/Embeddium。\n- Visual Overhaul - 開啟相機控制介面時會導致遊戲崩潰 - [GitHub Issue](https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/19)\n- Exordium - 透過觀景窗觀察時會引發問題與畫面閃爍。\n- FastAnim (Fabric) - 會破壞手持相機時的玩家模型動畫。[Github Issue](https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/71)\n\n<h1> </h1>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n#### 喜歡這個模組嗎？您的支持將讓我能夠繼續開發本模組及其他作品！\n[<img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon_seamless.png\" width=558.73/>](https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/membership)[<img alt=\"PayPal\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal_seamless.png\" width=191.75/>](https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=4VPMCBCLZVUEA)\n[<img alt=\"Golden Camera\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_golden_camera.png\" width=1000/>](https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/posts/rewards-129739244)\n\n<h1> </h1>\n\n[<img alt=\"Discord Server\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" width=500/>](https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et)\n\n</div>",
